usage: submission97e.py [-h]
                        [--packet {packet49-integrate,packet49b-gemv,packet49c-round2,packet97-record-bundle,packet49d-round3}]
                        [--update-record RESULT_JSON]
                        [--submission-id SUBMISSION_ID] [--chain CHAIN]
                        [--oracle ORACLE] [--output OUTPUT]

CPU-only packet49 lineage evidence builder and offline submission validator.
No runtime imports, subprocesses, model reads, device calls or network access.
Original evidence bytes are retained in a portable gzip/base64 bundle. The
helper replays the same checks from that bundle, rather than trusting a
computed headline.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --packet {packet49-integrate,packet49b-gemv,packet49c-round2,packet97-record-bundle,packet49d-round3}
  --update-record RESULT_JSON
                        Append a validated submitted result to the pinned
                        record ledger
  --submission-id SUBMISSION_ID
                        Real submission ID supplied by coordinator after
                        successful submission
  --chain CHAIN         Finished registered chain (read only)
  --oracle ORACLE
  --output OUTPUT
